* TIMES.jl crafted case demo12_refit_afc (reference/crafted.toml, 6 Nov 2026): the refit case
* demo12_refit (refit.dd) plus a commodity availability on the coal plant that retires,
* for M1.3 change 20b-2 (docs/m13-plan.md): EQL_CAFLAC on the fuel input ELCCOA of ELCTECOA00
* (not on ELC: an NCAP_AFC on the primary group becomes NCAP_AF, ppm_ext.vda), a PRC_RCAP process,
* reaches the %RCAPSBM% term of eqcaflac.vda L32 (prepret.dsc L88), which no suite model
* reaches. A second past vintage of ELCTECOA00 in REG1 (NCAP_PASTI 1995) puts two retiring
* vintages in the same row, which tells the two readings of %RCAPSBM% apart there (MODLYEAR
* summed over every vintage, or tied to K). TIMES_Demo demo12 (etsap-TIMES/TIMES_Demo @ 962db86,
* CC BY 4.0).
* Change 20b-3 (prepret.dsc L66-76): retirement bounds no suite model has, RCAP_BND LO and FX
* (L66, L70, L73) on ELCTECOA00 in REG1 and a negative 'N' option (L68, L76) in REG2.
$ONEMPTY
$ONEPS
$ONWARNING
PARAMETER
NCAP_AFC ' '/
REG1.2005.ELCTECOA00.ELCCOA.ANNUAL 2.5
REG2.2005.ELCTECOA00.ELCCOA.ANNUAL 2.4
/

PARAMETER
NCAP_PASTI ' '/
REG1.1995.ELCTECOA00 3
/

PARAMETER
RCAP_BND ' '/
REG1.2015.ELCTECOA00.LO 0.5
REG1.2030.ELCTECOA00.FX 1
REG2.0.ELCTECOA00.N -5
/
